   2810  f9c1							; PositionBallM1 — D6 asymmetric objects, BOTH positioned in one VBL call.
   2811  f9c1							; WHY here: pre-pad headroom is 1B — inline ball+m1 (22B) cannot live in the
   2812  f9c1							; VBL block, so the ball block became this jsr and the body sits in the
   2813  f9c1							; $F9C4..$FBF7 fill (ReturnPad pin at $FBF8 unaffected; F6-safe:
