   3980  fe9c							; TallyWork — level-bonus count-up (user spec 2026-10-02): reaching the miner
   3981  fe9c							; freezes the frame (dispatch bypasses input/physics/enemies via DropTarget
   3982  fe9c							; $FE), bank2 TallyEntry adds +50 every 4 frames and writes the coin tone
   3983  fe9c							; (every 200 pts); when TallyTicks hits 0 the done path advances the level
   3984  fe9c							; exactly like the old CheckMinerPickup tail, then rejoins OverscanAudio.
   3985  fe9c							;   Event bits in A (through ReturnPad sta/rts): b0 = add 50, b2 = done.
   3986  fe9c							;   Tail mirrors TitleWork: UpdateBombSound holds the coin (BombSnd>0), jet
   3987  fe9c							;   muted, own INTIM wait -> StartFrame: timer block skipped = frozen scene.
   3988  fe9c							; Lives in the $FE8C LHT..moth fill (bank0 has no pre-pad headroom).
   3989  fe9c							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3990  fe9c				   TallyWork
   3991  fe9c		       20 e6 ff 	      jsr	TallyTramp	; A = event (bank2 TallyEntry step)
   3992  fe9f		       a8		      tay
   3993  fea0		       29 01		      and	#1
   3994  fea2		       f0 05		      beq	.TNoScore
   3995  fea4		       a9 50		      lda	#$50	; BCD +50 per tick (pack is $50 exactly)
   3996  fea6		       20 0b fc 	      jsr	CallPad_AddScore
   3997  fea9				   .TNoScore
   3998  fea9		       98		      tya
   3999  feaa		       29 04		      and	#4
   4000  feac		       f0 1e		      beq	.TLive
   4001  feae		       e6 a3		      inc	Level	; --- done: advance (old CheckMinerPickup tail)
   4002  feb0		       a5 a3		      lda	Level
